From b99895948098f8561196eec86fe6d9401fa80a33 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ozark <ozark@localhost>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 21:26:27 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 09/10] Equalizer tab on the Media page

Ten bands (31 Hz to 16 kHz, +/-12 dB) with presets (Flat, Rock, Pop,
Jazz, Classical, Vocal, Electronic, Bass Boost, Treble Boost, Loudness)
and a Custom curve that's kept when a band is moved. The bands drive an
equalizer that PulseAudio runs in front of the output (LADSPA sink
'ozark_eq'), changed live through PulseAudio's D-Bus interface; the
preamp drops by the largest boost so boosts can't clip.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [needs Ozark OS's PulseAudio setup]
